{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_08_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_08","title":"汐斯塔狂想曲","storyCode":"OF-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"03b15b86ffc0ac410920c58732a318eebcdc2619c7d436c5fad13b83bb888266","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"在火山的另一边，竟然有这样一个洞窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"这个洞窟原本应该是天然形成的，但是经过了大量人为黑曜石开采，内部已经变成一个很深的矿洞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家要做好准备，我们要在里面走相当长的一段路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我的真正的目的地，就在这个洞窟的深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"在研究室的时候我可是做梦也想不到，有一天我会在度假的时候深入火山深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可以好好解释一下了吗，刚才在通信里说的太笼统了，“这次火山爆发是可以阻止的”究竟是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......解说还是交给天火好了，你来解释吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我和普罗旺斯之前在火山内部探索，然后跟艾雅法拉远程交流得出的结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"提到原理，首先得从这里源石虫的生态说起......不，说不定称呼它们为火山源石虫或者熔岩源石虫更为合适吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然外表与源石虫几乎一样，但是它们以火山为巢穴，以这里特别的黑曜石为食，在汐斯塔的火山内部筑巢生根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"这些源石虫居住的地方会非常接近火山的核心，也正好是这种混合了特殊成分的黑曜石大量产生的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里的人发现了这个特性，利用它们的踪迹来发掘黑曜石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，我看过一些资料，有些地方的人，是通过生物的一些特性来寻找和发掘资源的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"人们总是能从和生物的联系中找到规律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"问题就在于，这座火山距离上次喷发已经是很久以前了，这里的黑曜石是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"过度开采不仅对人们产生了影响，也破坏了源石虫的居住环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"于是它们的行为明显开始躁动起来，估计大量不正常的火山内部活动都是它们开辟居住地的行为导致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"这种行为对源石虫来说是有效扩张居住地的手段，但是对于汐斯塔市来说大概就是灭顶之灾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......“如果我们不怀抱着敬畏之心对待自然的馈赠，自然必然会赐以惩罚。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我们现在到底是要怎么做呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我们还能通过什么手段，将火山堵上吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"换个说法，应该是，我们需要让这里的主人安稳下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"动作快，我们往深处走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"越来越热了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"就在前面不远了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——————————！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"这声音？听起来.......好像很狂暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了，这些虫的智力程度并不足以让他们以个体行为扩张居住地，那么，必然有一只特别的母虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"它才是这里的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......要从那么多源石虫里找到那什么母虫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？这可是一只差点引发了火山喷发的熔岩源石虫，它主宰着整座火山！肯定是一眼就能看出来的狠角色啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"被环境因素刺激变异的个体，可能性太多了，说不定可以瞬间融化一整支重装小队喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，这个让整个岩壁都在隐隐作响的声音，是一只“源石虫”发出的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"慌什么，有我在这里。就算这些熔岩源石虫再怎么变异也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......难道岩浆已经蔓延出来了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是那只变异了的源石虫！在洞穴的下方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石虫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石虫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"温度在升高，这样的热量，作为一只源石虫而言，的确有些超出规格了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......那真的还能叫虫？那不就是一整座移动的火山吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......毕竟没有详细的推演，与我推算的变异结果稍微有点差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我有点想念艾雅法拉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！它靠近了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石虫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石虫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————————！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"它、它能让地面融化流动？不，不对，墙壁上地面上，布满了这些滚动着的像波浪一样的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"离远些，那些全部都是熔岩源石虫，这是足够引发火山运动的数量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"那么毫无疑问，目标就是这家伙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只要让它停止躁动，并且改变它行进的路线，应该就能有效的争取到更多让市民做好避难准备的时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着慢着！只凭我们几个到底怎么解决这座小型火山！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"打啊！还能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普罗旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"这样庞大的身体要是直接在这里爆炸，真的不会直接引发火山喷发吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻烦他回到巢穴里去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"总之还是得揍它嘛！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普罗旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
